---
import Prose from "../Prose.astro";
import Footnote from "../Footnote.astro";
import Anchor from "../Anchor.astro";
---

<section id="about" class="section">
  <h2 class="eyebrow">About Me</h2>

  <Prose>
    <p>I'm a London-based software developer who enjoys focusing on web-based technologies.</p>

    <p>
      Most of the time, I work with TypeScript and C# (with a hint of Rust) on projects like
      websites, APIs, apps, and command line tools.
    </p>

    <p>This website is a place for me to share cool things I find or create.</p>

    <h3>Experience</h3>

    <p>
      By day I'm a Senior Software Developer for <Anchor
        href="https://trayport.com"
        text="Trayport Ltd."
      /> in their London office. I spend my time working on React frontends and C# backends across various
      parts of the organization.
    </p>

    <p>
      In the past, I've worked with technologies such as Java Spring and Angular, creating web-based
      mobile apps in the commerce sector.
    </p>

    <p>
      My education has roots in video game development, which means I also have experience creating
      projects using both the Unity Game Engine and OpenGL.
    </p>

    <Footnote>
      All opinions and views expressed on this site are my own and do not represent those of my
      employers.
    </Footnote>

    <h3>My Code</h3>

    <p>
      I keep all my personal code on my GitHub profile, <Anchor
        href="https://github.com/tobysmith568"
        text="tobysmith568"
      />. My projects are usually public, so feel free to look around.
    </p>

    <p>
      Projects created as part of my university degree have been moved over to a separate archive
      account, which can be found at <Anchor
        href="https://github.com/tobysmith568-university"
        text="tobysmith568-university"
      />.
    </p>

    <p>
      Projects where I collaborate with others are usually kept in their own GitHub organizations,
      which can also be found on my profile.
    </p>
  </Prose>
</section>
